<title>HONG KONG: Trade in Indesen Ind shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trade in Indesen Ind shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Indesen Industries Co Ltd was suspended on Friday morning at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said.  </p>
<p>Shares of Indesen, a video cassette maker, surged HK$0.24 to HK$1.16 on Friday morning before trading was suspended at 11.27 a.m. (0327 GMT).</p>
<p>A total of 32.55 million shares worth HK$34.47 million changed hands.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6369</p>
</text>
